                "entry_id": "7d434764-dfee-3b43-a0c5-eca4c300c646",
                "word": "ingetogenheid",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4f217356-eeed-3af9-b848-4ebdb4b5dec7",
                        "entry_id": "7d434764-dfee-3b43-a0c5-eca4c300c646",
                        "glosses": [
                            "keurige en bescheiden manier van doen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb845063-f29e-4542-aa14-0d71a2b37782",
                                "sense_id": "4f217356-eeed-3af9-b848-4ebdb4b5dec7",
                                "text": "Ze rukte zo hard aan zijn stropdas en overhemd dat er een knoopje vanaf sprong. Bij de zevenentachtigjarige Juliana had, in de formulering van de regisseur, 'de ingetogenheid plaats gemaakt voor een ongeremde wil om te laten merken hoe ze er echt over dacht'. De lunch betekende `een welkome onderbreking. Prins Bernhard nam daarna het initiatief door als eerste een alinea van de gewraakte tekst voor te lezen, de gekalmeerde Juliana vervolgde met een door haar uitgesproken alinea.' 22"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ddc0651-181b-4d22-9539-3164555f3d6f",
                                "sense_id": "4f217356-eeed-3af9-b848-4ebdb4b5dec7",
                                "text": "Ze dronken hun Martini's. Gaandeweg veranderde er iets aan de sfeer. De ingetogenheid balde zich samen tot een voelbare spanning. De vrouwen werden beweeglijker, losser, vrolijker, uitbundig."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29ec04ab-85b4-4817-ae83-1128e0d4bfc3",
                                "sense_id": "4f217356-eeed-3af9-b848-4ebdb4b5dec7",
                                "text": "De hoofdredactie kijkt redelijk tevreden terug op die ingetogenheid. Maar de worsteling blijft. De krant had eerder dan maandag een reportage willen hebben over de meespeurende burgers. Ook het gewenste gedegen profiel van de verdachte bleef uit. Daarin moet de krant 'creatiever' zijn, zegt de hoofdredactie. Op het gevaar af dat je via de U-bocht alsnog de sensatiezucht voedt. 'De katholieke route' heet dat intern, en die is niet altijd fraai."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5fc2bb7c-9692-44dc-b912-e69316040930",
                        "source_entry_id": "7d434764-dfee-3b43-a0c5-eca4c300c646",
                        "source_sense_id": "4f217356-eeed-3af9-b848-4ebdb4b5dec7",
                        "source_sense_description": "keurige en bescheiden manier van doen",
                        "target_lang_word": "modesty",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "modesty",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0aa111ba-e157-3804-8328-483b46f1c26b",
                                        "entry_id": "7f4011fc-1436-3671-acb0-a80564210559",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being modest; having a limited and not overly high opinion of oneself and one's abilities."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83a91821-dcfd-466d-84ae-c66850791baa",
                                                "sense_id": "0aa111ba-e157-3804-8328-483b46f1c26b",
                                                "text": "At her invitation he outlined for her the succeeding chapters with terse military accuracy ; and what she liked best and best understood was avoidance of that false modesty which condescends, turning technicality into pabulum."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "174e3b69-ffe2-34e2-a038-a80f346051fa",
                                        "entry_id": "7f4011fc-1436-3671-acb0-a80564210559",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Moderate behaviour; reserve."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c402cf68-4e85-3f8c-be2a-22eaa5b69ffa",
                                        "entry_id": "7f4011fc-1436-3671-acb0-a80564210559",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pudency, avoidance of sexual explicitness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "specifically",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b203066-537c-4b5a-aa64-ccc3d0417121",
                                                "sense_id": "c402cf68-4e85-3f8c-be2a-22eaa5b69ffa",
                                                "text": "... but the cars of chaste women have either coverings thrown over them, or white sheets hung over; for instance, on the cars of the female part of the family of the deceased Nawabs Khanduran and Muzaffar Khan, there used generally to be fastened thick dirty white cloths, and in like manner also on their palanquins—although one brother was the chief treasurer, and the other a commander of seven thousand men. And most assuredly this is a requirement of modesty; for one whose palanquin or cart is turned out with much splendour, verily the idea comes to the minds of the sight-seers and common people, that in it there must be some lovely one, bright as the morning, the envy of the fairies. Hence, for the cars or palanquins for women to ride in to be greatly embroidered is, in the opinion of certain men of standing, who are worthy to be trusted, of great infamy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8956bf6a-f6bc-45d3-a1ef-ad3e36893f42",
                        "source_entry_id": "7d434764-dfee-3b43-a0c5-eca4c300c646",
                        "source_sense_id": "4f217356-eeed-3af9-b848-4ebdb4b5dec7",
                        "source_sense_description": "keurige en bescheiden manier van doen",
                        "target_lang_word": "continence",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "continence",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "41c3d73c-998b-3e42-84ff-d097df98f3f1",
                                        "entry_id": "3da8ff0e-16fb-3fc8-8942-2dd5773d25d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The voluntary control of urination and defecation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3d3751b-e3a3-48c5-b1fd-933d9dfedd52",
                                                "sense_id": "41c3d73c-998b-3e42-84ff-d097df98f3f1",
                                                "text": "To maintain continence, the puborectalis muscle chokes the anal canal. The sling of tissue is supposed to release during defecation. Mine has not been doing that."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc468b31-68ed-3328-8a39-3ad7bb0c64b4",
                                        "entry_id": "3da8ff0e-16fb-3fc8-8942-2dd5773d25d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Moderation or self-restraint, especially in sexual activity; abstinence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8da79d5a-adff-44ce-9bad-f33cb8b3130f",
                                                "sense_id": "dc468b31-68ed-3328-8a39-3ad7bb0c64b4",
                                                "text": "For quotations using this term, see Citations:continence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7cca92a-035f-4905-9b7d-1e6693fcbf09",
                                                "sense_id": "dc468b31-68ed-3328-8a39-3ad7bb0c64b4",
                                                "text": "He knew what to say; he knew also, when to leave off, — a continence which is practised by few writers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "129ded57-0e77-4905-a2e8-61f6e8e5f161",
                                                "sense_id": "dc468b31-68ed-3328-8a39-3ad7bb0c64b4",
                                                "text": "Chastity is either abstinence or continence: abstinence is that of virgins or widows; continence of married persons."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7e0f535-6f90-49eb-b99e-cd48a12d404e",
                                                "sense_id": "dc468b31-68ed-3328-8a39-3ad7bb0c64b4",
                                                "text": "For this was a line so little frequented, especially at this hour, when the driver, the stoker, the guard and the station staffs all along the line, were anhelating towards their wives, after the long hours of continence, that the train would hardly draw up, when it would be off again, like a bouncing ball."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8980b58a-9cf3-3769-8b13-8dfebd3edb78",
                                        "entry_id": "3da8ff0e-16fb-3fc8-8942-2dd5773d25d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Uninterrupted course; continuity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2580ab04-a6f4-4d66-a442-14c305b8a052",
                                                "sense_id": "8980b58a-9cf3-3769-8b13-8dfebd3edb78",
                                                "text": "the Continence of the Cause should be divided"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
